skills reference › KISS VM Language Reference › 9. Testing workflow › 1. `runscript` — offline unit tests (fast, first line of defense)
```
runscript script:"ASSERT SIGNEDBY(0xFF..AA) RETURN TRUE"
  state:{"0":"123"} prevstate:{"0":"100"}
  globals:{"@COINAGE":"50","@AMOUNT":"10"}
  signatures:["0xFF..AA"]
